   "about": "The PIP's requestAttributes hold ${tenant}, ${PARITY_R33_CONST} and x-${requestId}: placeholders that name neither the subject nor the resource. pipCalls records what the call carried: each text as written, as ${operation} was in round 32 (r32gaps-request-attribute-operation), or null.",
   "condition": "subject.parityR33Sources == 'v' OR resource.a == 'y'",
   "requests": [
